{"game": "risk-of-rain-2", "language": "english", "appid": 632360, "month": "2019-03", "window": 4, "start_date": 1553385600, "end_date": 1554076799, "month_true_total": 5307, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-13 02:41:29 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "49884727", "author": {"steamid": "76561198117003902", "personaname": "Mstrpwnr", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198117003902/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2915, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 60, "last_played": 1652680417, "avatar": "d0530dfa6a9f761a91f3924e75809a6c3b208fc1"}, "language": "english", "review": "This ♥♥♥♥ is fun as ♥♥♥♥", "timestamp_created": 1554076717, "timestamp_updated": 1554076717, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "49884703", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056147040", "personaname": "Fields", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fieldswork/", "num_games_owned": 139, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 1006, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 286, "deck_playtime_at_review": 38, "last_played": 1754264972, "avatar": "b56ae29574231c89ffb6d363d76576a22fb3f87d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Got this for myself, gave another copy to a friend, haven't had this much fun playing a game in a solid while. It's like they gave the original Risk of Rain the BOTW visuals treatment, and the game concept works beautifully in 3 dimensions.\n\nAlso, the music is transcendent.", "timestamp_created": 1554076541, "timestamp_updated": 1685657747, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504587173461914062", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49884654", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080769681", "personaname": "tellurius", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/europoorukrainia/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1646, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10, "last_played": 1612665110, "avatar": "5887a0c8c11341f7cd4c6e91e97cdef607505b05"}, "language": "english", "review": "As someone who never EVER buys games in early access (especially at full price), I can EASILY say that this game it worth it. I played the original Risk of Rain a bit after it came out, and I really enjoyed it. The developers have really done a fantastic job with this already (especially with the transition from 2D to 3D), and I can't wait to see what is in the future.", "timestamp_created": 1554076262, "timestamp_updated": 1554076262, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49884651", "author": {"steamid": "76561198206189349", "personaname": "AnOrkyGit", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198206189349/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 423, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 94, "last_played": 1644981075, "avatar": "d48f73d4759d675022e95f63111abcc2eacfe43c"}, "language": "english", "review": "so far 9/10, music is amazing, graphics are nice to look at especially the backdrops, enemy's are fun to fight.\nmy only grief with the game is sometimes the boss arena can be in a cramped space or by the side of a cliff making maneuvering on high difficulties very hard.", "timestamp_created": 1554076237, "timestamp_updated": 1554076237, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49884627", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041864093", "personaname": "rubbrfist", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198041864093/", "num_games_owned": 205, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 6263, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 848, "last_played": 1680395572, "avatar": "6330c0531c83e7262767b52a29728f6801bcc289"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the best alpha I have ever played. The controls are great, the maps are fun and the items are... bonkers. I am really impressed with the air targeting of some projectiles (MUL-T Blast Canister). Most of the classes seem to be fairly balanced, except for huntress. She seems weak given that you cant sprint backwards. Engineer seems to be the strongest, his turrets completely shred once you stack up items. \n\nRisk of Rain 2 is a prime example of moving from 2D to 3D. After 60+ hours in Risk of Rain 1, the classes and items feel familiar without being direct copies, and the gameplay is super smooth. Well done! I can't wait for updates!\n\nOverall: 9/10", "timestamp_created": 1554076094, "timestamp_updated": 1554076094, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}]}